---
// Leadership: the role today, and what colleagues say. Only recommendations approved by their authors appear here.
import '../styles/chapter.css';
---
<section class="ch lead" id="leadership" aria-labelledby="ld-t">
  <div class="open">
    <p class="meta kick">Leadership</p>
    <h2 id="ld-t">Analyst by trade. <em>Manager by choice.</em></h2>
    <svg class="sig" data-sig="lead" viewBox="0 0 320 200" aria-hidden="true"></svg>
    <p class="ch-lede">From BI analyst in 2019 to leading a team of six BI developers today.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="row4">
    <p class="meta">The role today · Corient</p>
    <ul class="rules">
      <li class="rule"><h3>A team of six</h3><p>I lead six BI developers who deliver analytical solutions to the whole group.</p></li>
      <li class="rule"><h3>One platform</h3><p>I own the Power BI platform, with its governance, security and scalability.</p></li>
      <li class="rule"><h3>Automation and AI</h3><p>I drive the adoption of automation and AI, to raise the business's performance.</p></li>
      <li class="rule"><h3>Reporting strategy</h3><p>I shape it with the group's leadership, and keep it compliant.</p></li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="says">
    <p class="meta">What colleagues say</p>
    <figure class="feat">
      <blockquote><p>“I praise his dedication and sense of ownership, as he took every task as his own and could always be counted on to see a problem through to the end. … Any team would be lucky to have him.”</p></blockquote>
      <figcaption class="who"><b>Daniela Gomez</b>Operation Team Manager at HOP, and Wilson's manager</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="more">
      <figure>
        <blockquote><p>“Wilson is a hard-working, honest and intelligent person always willing to help the team. … He was able to understand the business needs and helped us gain clarity of strategic objectives…”</p></blockquote>
        <figcaption class="who"><b>José Matos</b>Program Manager, on the same team at Scores &amp; Levels · <a class="ul" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/wilson-lisboa-mota/" rel="noopener">On LinkedIn</a></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure>
        <blockquote><p>“From the IT side, what stood out was how well he bridged business and technology. … He was ambitious, yet careful with data, reliable and easy to work with.”</p></blockquote>
        <figcaption class="who"><b>Rodrigo Taveira</b>Head of IT at Scores &amp; Levels</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="close"></div>
</section>

<style>
  .says{margin-top:clamp(64px,11vh,120px)}
  .says > .meta{margin-bottom:18px}
  .feat{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:18px 48px;padding:34px 0 40px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  @media (min-width:980px){.feat{grid-template-columns:minmax(180px,2.2fr) minmax(0,6fr) minmax(0,3.8fr)}.feat blockquote{grid-column:2/-1}.feat .who{grid-row:1;grid-column:1;padding-top:.5em}}
  .feat blockquote p{font-size:clamp(25px,2.3vw,34px);line-height:1.3;font-weight:520;letter-spacing:-.015em;max-width:34ch;text-indent:-.42em}
  .who{font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--t2)}
  .who b{display:block;font-weight:600;color:var(--t1)}
  .who a{white-space:nowrap}
  .more{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:0 48px}
  @media (min-width:980px){.more{margin-left:calc((100% - 96px) * 2.2 / 12 + 48px);grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}
  .more figure{padding:26px 0 30px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .more blockquote p{font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--t1);text-indent:-.4em;max-width:52ch}
  .more .who{margin-top:14px}
  /* On a phone the gutter is too narrow for the opening quote mark to hang outside the text. */
  @media (max-width:979px){.feat blockquote p,.more blockquote p{text-indent:0}}
</style>
